      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>[2]</strong> <strong>Carmenati F.</strong>, Schlup Y., Kägi A., Six J., Vogelgsang S.:
        Are hull-less barley and lentil a good match? Production performance and co-growth dynamics in a three-year mixed cropping experiment in Switzerland. <em>Field Crops Research</em> (under review).
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>[3]</strong> <strong>Carmenati F.</strong>, Holmes J., Matsumoto A., Kägi A., Six J., Vogelgsang S.:
        Crop identity rather than cropping system drives ecosystem service delivery in lentil, narrow-leaved lupin, and buckwheat systems. <em>Agriculture, Ecosystems &amp; Environment</em> (under review)
      </li>
    </ul>

